        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "refactor(ui): remove dead exports",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe shrink-only dead-export ratchet still carried 377 `ui/` entries, allowing unused Control UI exports to remain indefinitely.\n\nCloses #105791\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Internalize unused Control UI symbols, deleting helpers and tests that existed only for those exports.\n- Keep meaningful behavior coverage through production-owned modules and public component boundaries.\n- Split custom-element registration side effects where production consumers need the implementation export.\n- Regenerate the dead-export baseline with no remaining entries whose path starts with `ui/`.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo intended user-visible behavior change. The Control UI exposes a smaller internal module surface while retaining gateway reconnect, stale-chunk recovery, component registration, chat, workspace, and navigation behavior.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `pnpm tsgo:ui`\n- `pnpm tsgo:test:ui`\n- `pnpm test:ui` — 235 files, 3,448 tests passed ([Crabbox run](https://crabbox.openclaw.ai/portal/runs/run_d3b4c266fe4a))\n- `pnpm build` ([Crabbox run](https://crabbox.openclaw.ai/portal/runs/run_5e21f4678d88))\n- `pnpm deadcode:exports:update`\n- `pnpm deadcode:exports`\n- `oxfmt --check` across all changed UI/baseline files\n- `git diff --check`\n- Fresh autoreview: no accepted/actionable findings\n",
